---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Aaron Holmes | Résumé Summary"
  description="Concise web résumé summary for Aaron Holmes. View the complete Primary résumé in PDF format."
>
  <main class="resume-page">
    <nav class="resume-actions" aria-label="Resume actions">
      <a href="/">← Back to portfolio</a>
      <a href="/Aaron_Holmes_Resume.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View full résumé (PDF)</a>
    </nav>

    <p class="resume-summary-note">This page is a shorter web summary. The <a href="/Aaron_Holmes_Resume.pdf">full two-page Primary résumé</a> includes additional experience and skills.</p>

    <article class="resume-paper">
      <header class="resume-header">
        <h1>Aaron Holmes</h1>
        <p class="resume-position">Business Systems | Integrations | Automation | Technical Implementation</p>
        <p class="resume-contact">
          Michigan (Remote) · 734-489-9849 · <a href="mailto:aaronholmesdev@gmail.com">aaronholmesdev@gmail.com</a> ·
          <a href="https://aaronholmes.dev">aaronholmes.dev</a> ·
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/aaronholmesdev/">LinkedIn</a>
        </p>
      </header>

      <section>
        <h2>Profile</h2>
        <p>Business systems and technical implementation specialist who connects operational needs to maintainable applications, integrations and automation. Bridges requirements discovery, hands-on configuration, API troubleshooting, data quality and user support across healthcare, restaurant SaaS, financial services and client projects. Brings substantial business-operations leadership and practical product judgment to technical problem solving, vendor relationships, documentation and adoption.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Core Skills</h2>
        <p>Application Ownership · Requirements Discovery · Process Mapping · Workflow Architecture · Solution Design · CRM Data Modeling · Normalization and Deduplication · Record Validation and Reconciliation · Production Troubleshooting · Root-Cause Analysis · Controlled Testing · Exception Monitoring · Automation Cost Analysis · SaaS Onboarding · Product Feedback · Training and Technical Handoffs</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Professional Experience</h2>
        <div class="resume-role">
          <div class="resume-role-header"><h3>TixWork <span>— SaaS Implementation, Product and Customer Support</span></h3><p>Current</p></div>
          <ul>
            <li>Support onboarding, issue triage, maintenance and customer communications for a restaurant-operations SaaS platform used across 100+ locations.</li>
            <li>Use restaurant-operations experience during demos and customer discussions to translate maintenance, staffing and field workflows into useful product requirements.</li>
            <li>Bring operator feedback into feature, usability and development-priority discussions.</li>
            <li>Investigate issues with customers and developers, clarify symptoms and expected behavior, and coordinate follow-up in language operators can understand.</li>
            <li>Contribute to product maintenance and evolving customer-acquisition and marketing work.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="resume-role">
          <div class="resume-role-header"><h3>Lincoln Health Supply <span>— Business Systems Automation Engineer</span></h3><p>Sep 2025–Aug 2026 · Remote</p></div>
          <ul>
            <li>Worked with the COO to define operational requirements and built auditable centralized Deluge rules for duplicate detection, branch ownership and supplier routing using a 30-day window and request-status conditions; validated combinations using controlled spreadsheet test cases.</li>
            <li>Diagnosed and corrected upstream Zoho Flow branch and owner routing defects after an estimated 500–600 leads were affected over about two months; added exception alerts and reviewed 300+ new and historical records with leadership during approximately one week of post-fix validation.</li>
            <li>Built a custom multi-endpoint pVerify REST integration in Zapier with bearer-token authentication, JSON mapping, response normalization and CRM updates; avoided an estimated 10 minutes of manual staff effort per routine verification.</li>
            <li>Trained a colleague to support Zoho and Zapier independently; documentation and knowledge transfer contributed to an estimated 10+ team hours weekly in reduced troubleshooting, escalations and support.</li>
            <li>Served as a primary hands-on technical resource for an inherited environment of 400+ Zoho CRM workflows, about 150 existing Deluge functions and hundreds of Zapier automations.</li>
            <li>Connected Zoho Survey, Google Sheets, Zoho Flow, CRM, HCPCS and product logic, documents and orders for compression-garment intake processes.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="resume-role">
          <div class="resume-role-header"><h3>AviKaiDo <span>— Business Systems and Automation Consultant</span></h3><p>Jan 2019–Sept 2025</p></div>
          <ul>
            <li>Built websites, data-driven automations, integrations, and client workflows across healthcare, financial services, publishing, and small businesses; handled discovery through troubleshooting.</li>
            <li>Created securities-backed lending sites and automations for High West Capital Partners, Global Stock Lenders, and International Liquidity Partners, using borrower and ticker data, market history, LTV rules, and deal documents.</li>
            <li>Developed Ask Your Primary’s pharmacy QR intake and CRM/fax integration prototype and TheRedZone’s automated content-ingestion and classification workflows.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="resume-role">
          <div class="resume-role-header"><h3>Ascend Internet Marketing <span>— Web Development, CRM and Client Delivery</span></h3><p>Nov 2015–Dec 2018</p></div>
          <ul>
            <li>Delivered website and CRM-related projects for clients including Schafer Development and Cure Launcher, spanning buildout, support, troubleshooting, and client communication.</li>
            <li>Worked on JK&amp;T Wings’ custom maintenance-tracking system, the original client solution that later evolved into the TixWork SaaS product.</li>
            <li>Coordinated requirements, developers and vendors, issue resolution, digital project milestones, and ongoing client support across multiple accounts.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Selected Independent Work and Community</h2>
        <p>Architecting a portable, model-agnostic AI context workspace using Markdown context routing, project records and selective retrieval; designed and tested a local Python and SQLite migration toolkit with provenance, sensitivity flags and human review gates. FIRST robotics volunteer since 2021, mentoring student design, programming and troubleshooting; supported FTC Team 8424 during its 2025 Michigan State Championship season.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Technology</h2>
        <p><strong>Business applications and connected services:</strong> Zoho CRM and Zoho One, Zoho Flow, Zoho Survey, Zapier, WordPress, Excel, Google Sheets, pVerify, PandaDoc, Phaxio, Telnyx, Sinch, document generation, fax and SMS</p>
        <p><strong>APIs and scripting:</strong> REST APIs, Webhooks, JSON, Bearer Tokens, Zoho COQL, Deluge, JavaScript</p>
        <p><strong>Development tools:</strong> Python, TypeScript, SQL, Node.js, HTML/CSS, Astro, Playwright, BeautifulSoup, Git and GitHub, Linux and WSL, VS Code</p>
        <p><strong>Cloud labs and local AI:</strong> AWS Academy (EC2, RDS, VPC, IAM, S3, Secrets Manager), LM Studio, Local Model APIs; selected applied OpenAI API workflows</p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .resume-page {
    width: min(100% - 2rem, 960px);
    margin: 2rem auto 5rem;
  }
  .resume-summary-note {
    margin: 0.4rem 0 1.5rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .resume-actions {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
  }
  .resume-actions button {
    padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 0.45rem;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: white;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .resume-paper {
    padding: 2.2rem 2.5rem;
    color: #1a2630;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #e0e5ea;
    box-shadow: 0 7px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.09);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }
  .resume-header {
    text-align: center;
  }
  .resume-header h1 {
    max-width: unset;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 2rem;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .resume-position {
    margin: 0.25rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.015em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .resume-contact {
    margin: 0.28rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.79rem;
  }
  .resume-paper a { color: #244f73; }
  .resume-paper section { margin-top: 0.85rem; }
  .resume-paper section > h2 {
    margin: 0 0 0.3rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.18rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #244f73;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: 0.045em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #244f73;
  }
  .resume-paper section p { margin: 0.25rem 0 0.4rem; }
  .resume-role { margin-top: 0.55rem; break-inside: avoid; }
  .resume-role-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  .resume-role-header h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }
  .resume-role-header h3 span { font-weight: 500; }
  .resume-role-header p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .resume-paper ul {
    padding-left: 1rem;
    margin: 0.25rem 0 0;
  }
  .resume-paper li { padding-left: 0.08rem; margin: 0 0 0.18rem; }
  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .resume-paper { padding: 1.3rem; }
    .resume-role-header { display: block; }
    .resume-role-header p { margin-top: 0.15rem; }
  }
  @page { size: letter; margin: 0.45in; }
  @media print {
    :global(.site-header) { display: none !important; }
    :global(body) { margin: 0; background: white !important; }
    .resume-page { width: auto; margin: 0; }
    .resume-actions { display: none; }
    .resume-paper {
      padding: 0;
      border: 0;
      box-shadow: none;
      font-size: 9pt;
      line-height: 1.22;
    }
    .resume-header h1 { font-size: 17pt; }
    .resume-paper section { margin-top: 0.46rem; }
    .resume-role { margin-top: 0.3rem; }
    .resume-paper li { margin-bottom: 0.1rem; }
    .resume-paper section > h2 { font-size: 9.2pt; }
    .resume-role-header h3 { font-size: 9.2pt; }
    .resume-contact { font-size: 8.2pt; }
    a { text-decoration: none; }
  }
</style>